MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_Fab_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_Fab_m01_001: I have looked into our next opponent in the games—\none Alexandra.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_Fab_m01_002: She is a knight at the temple of Jurah, the goddess of\nabundance and cultivation, and is of high birth.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_Fab_m01_003: But her parents are dead, and it seems an uncle\nserves as her guardian.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_Fab_m01_004: However that uncle is no nameless peasant. Indeed,\nhe holds a high rank within the temple.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_Fab_m01_005: I believe he may be exerting his influence over how\nthe games themselves are being run.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c06_Fab_m01: <BLN>I have uncovered much.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_Esm_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_Esm_m01_001: Everywhere I look in this city, I see women who are\nelegant. Refined.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_Esm_m01_002: For example, the more I hear about this Alexandra,\nthe more curious I get.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_Esm_m01_003: Come to think of it, there was that pretty lady who\nyou kissed the other day, Sweetie.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_Esm_m01_004: You must like those kinds of women, then, right?\nThe refined ones.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_Esm_m01_005: <NCA>Extol the virtue of beauty.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_Esm_m01_006: <NCB>Disagree.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_Esm_m01_007: <ACA>Hm. I wonder if we're really a match.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_Esm_m01_008: <ACB>Really? Thanks for saying so.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_Esm_m01_009: <ACB>But don't count me out!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_Esm_m01_010: So...how do I decide what to do next?
MID_LGA_1DIT_c06_Esm_m01: <BLN>Hmm... Now what?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_Mic_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_Mic_m01_001: Esmeralda has herself tied up in knots, and there's\nno need for any of that!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_Mic_m01_002: Once you start measuring yourself against the people\naround you, there's no end to it.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_Mic_m01_003: I don't know why she worries. She's a\ngood-looking girl!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_Mic_m01_004: If you ask me, I think it's just because it's her first\ntime in the big city. It's throwing her off.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_Mic_m01_005: It's tough for girls that age.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c06_Mic_m01: <BLN>She shouldn't let it bother her.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_Ale_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_Ale_m01_001: Oh my, aren't you... Yes, you're one of those whom\nI'll be up against in the next qualifier.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_Ale_m01_002: What an honor to meet you. I will fight you with all\nmy might. It's a matter of respect.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_Ale_m01_003: Many have lost sight of the original purpose of\nthese Heroic Games.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_Ale_m01_004: It wasn't purely meant to be a brutal spectacle.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_Ale_m01_005: The games are sacred—a series of battles dedicated\nto the Divine Emperor in his long slumber.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c06_Ale_m01: <BLN>I will fight with all my might.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_Set_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_Set_m01_001: Ah, it's you.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_Set_m01_002: Never forget what I told you.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c06_Set_m01: <BLN>Never forget...
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_B01_m01_001: Your next match is soon...isn't it?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_B01_m01_002: I know you'll do your best, but please...take this!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_B01_m01_003: You should know...my support for you will\nnever falter.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c06_B01_m01: <BLN>I believe in you!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_B02_m01_001: Alexandra, you're just divine!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_B02_m01_002: Like an angel flitting down from the heavens on\nyour pegasus...
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_B02_m01_003: I can't wait to actually see you fight in the\nnext match!
MID_LGA_1DIT_c06_B02_m01: <BLN>Alexandra, my angel...
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_B03_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_B03_m01_001: Alexandra, one day I'll be a dashing knight, just\nlike you!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_B03_m01_002: There's a special relationship between a pegasus\nand its rider. I need to make friends with one!
MID_LGA_1DIT_c06_B03_m01: <BLN>I wanna be a knight like her!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_B04_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_B04_m01_001: That Alexandra may act cute, but I have\nmy suspicions.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_B04_m01_002: All these fools fall for her smile, but I know the\ntruth—it's all an act!
MID_LGA_1DIT_c06_B04_m01: <BLN>It's all an act!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_B05_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_B05_m01_001: Be on guard. Your next match is against Alexandra,\nafter all.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_B05_m01_002: Rumor has it that something bad happened to the\nlast fighter unlucky enough to be paired with her.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_B05_m01_003: Someone dragged him into an alley and beat the\nstuffing out of him. He had to drop out of the games!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_B05_m01_004: Don't walk around the city at night unless you're\nlooking for trouble, is my advice.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c06_B05_m01: <BLN>You better watch yourself.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_B06_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_B06_m01_001: Rumor has it that there's someone powerful behind\nAlexandra's entry into the games.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_B06_m01_002: And he's going to do whatever it takes to make\nsure she wins!
MID_LGA_1DIT_c06_B06_m01: <BLN>Who's behind it all?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_B07_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_B07_m01_001: I've seen a particularly nasty-looking gang hanging\naround lowtown lately.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c06_B07_m01_002: If you have business there, watch your back.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c06_B07_m01: <BLN>Better watch your back.